{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あめいずぃーんぐっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の夜はアメイジングスパイダーマンの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"試写会と、ワールドプレミア24時間LIVE特番に参加してきました(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず試写会ゆーことで、一足お先に6/30公開の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アメイジングスパイダーマン-ＩＮ ３Ｄ-」を見ましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのお楽しみを奪うようなことあできんけれども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単にポイントをお伝えしましょ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、３Ｄだから表せるリアルさ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパイダーマンが戦いよったら、何かの破片みたいなんが飛んでくるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじで自分のとこに飛び散ったみたいで「ビクっ」てなったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパイダーマンが高いとこから下を見下ろすアングルが自分の目線みたいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹が冷やっとしたり、感動した(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん３Ｄ初めてだったんだけど、３Ｄ好きになったのよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、誰でも楽しめる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクション映画って言ったらやっぱ男の子もんなんかなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと抵抗があったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際16歳の女の子めっちゃ楽しめました＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たたかってるシーンはもちろん見ごたえあったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱ女の子みんな大好きなロマンスがあったりー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何気ないスクールライフはなんか共感できたりー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に女の子同士で見ても楽しめる映画です☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今までのスパイダーマンシリーズ見たことない人も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おるんじゃないでしょーうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この映画でスパイダーマンデビューしても全然問題なーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、ストーリーが新しくなったみたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも今作でスパイダーマンデビューしたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の続きとかないから普通にストーリー楽しかったよ(^O^)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで今日のしっつもーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にみた映画は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつみたのー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺は今日(12日)誕生日だから、ひめたんに祝ってほしいな(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキに何本ロウソクさしたのよー？にやにや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの誕生日のちょうど２ヶ月後ね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵ないちにちになりましたーかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんホームシックとかならないの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりかけたけど、どうにかして立ち直ってきた(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって帰らないってみなさんと約束したんだもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九州だと「片付ける」を「なおす」って言うけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京では「しまう」って言わないと全く通じないんだよね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島あたりではどっちを使ってますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なおす。しまう。どっちも使いますねーつかうつかう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、なおすって、方言とかわからんでもなんとなく伝わる気がせん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねーどゆことーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんに「くたばれ」って言われたとき、ひめたんは何て返したのかしら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅはいろんな人に「くたばれ」言いよるけどひめたんだけは例外。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜかっちゅーと、目があった瞬間にビームを飛ばすから。言わせないの。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなに制服あげるんだって?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、ひめたんの中学校の制服が、アニメのコスみたいらしくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわごさん(川後陽菜chan)的にツボらしい(ω)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー最近クリーニングからやっと帰ってきたけそろそろ渡さんにゃーねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂になって、初めて話したメンバーって誰?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂になってってゆーか、結成オーディションの時すでに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ(川村真洋chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん(畠中清羅chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅ(齋藤飛鳥chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや(和田まあやchan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちま(樋口日奈chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかは話してたかな(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン中の写メとかって怒られるの?練習着とか見てみたい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめた〜んといくちゃんのツーショットが見たいなぁ〜!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度かなりんとの２ショットがあれば載せてほしいなぁ(*´ε｀)人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/12/1295586/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんとツーショット希望_(._.)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの写めリクエストてーんきゅ＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン中はさすがに怒られるけど、前後なら全然撮れるよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも学校ある日は学校指定のジャージじゃけ可愛くなーい←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度いつかいい感じの服だったら撮ってみるねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご指名いただいたメンバーのみなさーんにお願いして２ショット撮ってくる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばしお待ちを!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}